# Used by "docker build -f aircheck/serving/Dockerfile ." (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Allowlist: skip everything, then add back only what the API needs. Models, data, notebooks, outputs,
# .git, .env and models.json never enter the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!bmfm_sm
!aircheck/serving/*.py
!aircheck/serving/requirements-serving.txt

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
bmfm_sm/**/tests
